              <a href="#">Inference Routing</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mega-col">
              <h4>Core Platform</h4>
              <a href="#">Edge Runtime</a>
              <a href="#">Global Builds</a>
              <a href="#">Observability</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mega-col">
              <h4>Security</h4>
              <a href="#">Zero Trust Access</a>
              <a href="#">Secrets Manager</a>
              <a href="#">Compliance Center</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dropdown" data-dropdown="resources">
          <button class="dropdown-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Resources ▾</button>
          <div class="mega" role="menu" aria-label="Resources menu">
            <div class="mega-col">
              <h4>Company</h4>
              <a href="#">About</a>
              <a href="#">Careers</a>
              <a href="#">Press</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mega-col">
              <h4>Learn</h4>
              <a href="#">Documentation</a>
              <a href="#">Guides</a>
              <a href="#">Case Studies</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mega-col">
              <h4>Open Source</h4>
              <a href="#">SDKs</a>
              <a href="#">GitHub</a>
              <a href="#">Community Events</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Changelog</a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-link">Docs</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <h1 id="hero-title">DeployCloud Blog — Discover the latest in web development</h1>
      <p>A tech blog showcasing engineering insights, product updates, and community stories from a cloud deployment platform.</p>
      <div class="filters" id="categoryFilters"></div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="featured-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="featured-title">Featured Articles</h2>
        <p>Editorial highlights from our engineering and platform teams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="featured-grid" id="featuredGrid"></div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="latest-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="latest-title">Latest News</h2>
        <p>Chronological updates on releases, infrastructure, and developer stories.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news-grid" id="latestGrid"></div>
      <div class="empty" id="emptyState">No results found. Try another category or search term.</div>
      <div class="show-more-wrap">
        <button class="show-more" id="showMoreBtn">Show more posts</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-label="CTA banner">
      <div>
        <h3>Build, ship, and scale with DeployCloud</h3>
        <p>Explore AI-native deployment workflows, durable execution, and secure global delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#">Start free</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>DeployCloud</h4>
        <a href="#">Composable Commerce</a>
        <a href="#">Multi-tenant Platforms</a>
        <a href="#">Web Apps</a>
        <a href="#">Platform Engineers</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Company</h4>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Careers</a>
        <a href="#">Help</a>
        <a href="#">Press</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Resources</h4>
        <a href="#">Blog</a>
        <a href="#">Docs</a>
        <a href="#">Open Source Program</a>
        <a href="#">Events</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Legal</h4>
        <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="#">Terms</a>
        <a href="#">Security</a>
        <a href="#">Status: All Systems Normal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const categories = ["All Posts", "Engineering", "Community", "Company News", "Customers", "Security"];

    const featuredPosts = [
      {
        title: "Agentic Infrastructure is becoming core to modern deployment pipelines",
        category: "Engineering",
        date: "Apr 10, 2026",
        excerpt: "DeployCloud now sees 30% of deployments initiated by coding agents, a 1000% increase from six months ago, and these agent-driven projects are 20 times more likely to call AI inference services during runtime.",
        author: "Nadia Chen",
        initials: "NC",
        primary: true,
        tag: "Agentic Infrastructure"
      },
      {
        title: "A new programming model for durable execution",
        category: "Engineering",
        date: "Apr 3, 2026",
        excerpt: "How resumable workflows are changing backend reliability for long-running AI and event-driven systems.",
        author: "Omar Patel",
        initials: "OP",
        tag: "Architecture"
      },
      {
        title: "Agent responsibly",
        category: "Security",
        date: "Mar 24, 2026",
        excerpt: "Patterns for secure, auditable AI agent behavior across production software delivery pipelines.",
        author: "Riley Morgan",
        initials: "RM",
        tag: "Security"
      }
    ];

    const latestPosts = [
      { category: "Engineering", date: "Apr 3, 2026", title: "A new programming model for durable execution", excerpt: "Durable, resumable workloads simplify the way teams build reliable distributed systems.", author: "Omar Patel", initials: "OP" },
      { category: "Security", date: "Mar 30, 2026", title: "Zero Data Retention on AI Gateway", excerpt: "Introducing enterprise controls to process inference traffic without persisting sensitive prompts or responses.", author: "Leah Kim", initials: "LK" },
      { category: "Engineering", date: "Mar 28, 2026", title: "Optimizing Sandbox snapshots", excerpt: "A deep dive into faster warm starts and reduced cold-boot latency in ephemeral environments.", author: "Dylan Ruiz", initials: "DR" },
      { category: "Community", date: "Mar 21, 2026", title: "How a startup made a blog platform work for humans and AI alike", excerpt: "Designing content systems for readers and retrieval: metadata strategy, structure, and scale.", author: "Maya Scott", initials: "MS" },
      { category: "Customers", date: "Mar 16, 2026", title: "Making build tool 96% faster with agents, sandboxes, and humans", excerpt: "A customer story showing how hybrid automation transformed CI throughput under heavy load.", author: "Ethan Park", initials: "EP" },
      { category: "Company News", date: "Mar 11, 2026", title: "Unified reporting for all AI Gateway usage", excerpt: "A single analytics surface for model usage, spend trends, and policy enforcement across teams.", author: "Alina Roy", initials: "AR" },
      { category: "Engineering", date: "Mar 6, 2026", title: "Edge build queues with deterministic caching", excerpt: "How cache locality and queue shaping keep deploy times consistent worldwide.", author: "Iris Long", initials: "IL" },
      { category: "Company News", date: "Feb 27, 2026", title: "DeployCloud joins the Open Source Program", excerpt: "Expanding grants and maintainership support for developer tooling ecosystems.", author: "Noah Green", initials: "NG" },
      { category: "Community", date: "Feb 22, 2026", title: "Inside our global DevOps community week", excerpt: "Highlights from sessions on release quality, observability, and infrastructure DX.", author: "Sana Ali", initials: "SA" },
      { category: "Security", date: "Feb 15, 2026", title: "Policy packs for secure-by-default deployments", excerpt: "Prebuilt guardrails to enforce least privilege and supply-chain integrity from day one.", author: "Kai Torres", initials: "KT" }
    ];

    const initialVisible = 6;
    const increment = 3;

    let activeCategory = "All Posts";
    let query = "";
    let visibleCount = initialVisible;

    const categoryFiltersEl = document.getElementById("categoryFilters");
    const featuredGridEl = document.getElementById("featuredGrid");
    const latestGridEl = document.getElementById("latestGrid");
    const emptyStateEl = document.getElementById("emptyState");
    const showMoreBtn = document.getElementById("showMoreBtn");

    function makeCard(post, featured = false) {
      const card = document.createElement("article");
      card.className = `card ${featured && post.primary ? "featured-primary" : ""}`;
      card.innerHTML = `
        <span class="tag">${post.tag || post.category}</span>
        <div class="meta">${post.date} · ${post.category}</div>
        <h3>${post.title}</h3>
        <p>${post.excerpt}</p>
        ${post.primary ? `<div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">30% of deployments initiated by coding agents</div>
            <div class="stat">1000% increase from six months ago</div>
            <div class="stat">20× more likely to call AI inference</div>
          </div>` : ""}
        <div class="author"><span class="avatar">${post.initials}</span>${post.author}</div>
      `;
      return card;
    }

    function renderFilters() {
      const controls = document.createElement("div");
      controls.style.display = "flex";
      controls.style.gap = "0.8rem";
      controls.style.flexWrap = "wrap";

      categories.forEach((cat) => {
        const btn = document.createElement("button");
        btn.className = `pill ${cat === activeCategory ? "active" : ""}`;
        btn.textContent = cat;
        btn.setAttribute("aria-pressed", cat === activeCategory ? "true" : "false");
        btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          activeCategory = cat;
          visibleCount = initialVisible;
          renderFilters();
          renderLatest();
        });
        controls.appendChild(btn);
      });

      const searchWrap = document.createElement("div");
      searchWrap.className = "search-wrap";
      const search = document.createElement("input");
      search.type = "search";
      search.placeholder = "Search posts";
      search.setAttribute("aria-label", "Search posts");
      search.value = query;
      search.addEventListener("input", (e) => {
        query = e.target.value.trim().toLowerCase();
        visibleCount = initialVisible;
        renderLatest();
      });
      searchWrap.appendChild(search);

      categoryFiltersEl.innerHTML = "";
      categoryFiltersEl.appendChild(controls);
      categoryFiltersEl.appendChild(searchWrap);
    }

    function renderFeatured() {
      featuredGridEl.innerHTML = "";
      featuredPosts.forEach((post) => featuredGridEl.appendChild(makeCard(post, true)));
    }

    function getFiltered() {
      return latestPosts.filter((post) => {
        const categoryOk = activeCategory === "All Posts" || post.category === activeCategory;
        const haystack = `${post.title} ${post.excerpt} ${post.author} ${post.category}`.toLowerCase();
        const queryOk = !query || haystack.includes(query);
        return categoryOk && queryOk;
      });
    }

    function renderLatest() {
      const filtered = getFiltered();
      latestGridEl.innerHTML = "";

      const visible = filtered.slice(0, visibleCount);
      visible.forEach((post) => latestGridEl.appendChild(makeCard(post)));

      const hasResults = filtered.length > 0;
      emptyStateEl.style.display = hasResults ? "none" : "block";

      const canShowMore = filtered.length > visibleCount;
      showMoreBtn.style.display = hasResults ? "inline-flex" : "none";
      showMoreBtn.disabled = !canShowMore;
      showMoreBtn.textContent = canShowMore ? "Show more posts" : "No more posts";
      showMoreBtn.style.opacity = canShowMore ? "1" : "0.6";
      showMoreBtn.style.cursor = canShowMore ? "pointer" : "default";
    }

    showMoreBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const filtered = getFiltered();
      if (visibleCount < filtered.length) {
        visibleCount += increment;
        renderLatest();
      }
    });

    function setupDropdowns() {
      const dropdowns = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".dropdown"));

      function closeAll() {
        dropdowns.forEach((d) => {
          d.querySelector(".mega").classList.remove("open");
          d.querySelector(".dropdown-trigger").setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
        });
      }

      dropdowns.forEach((dropdown) => {
        const trigger = dropdown.querySelector(".dropdown-trigger");
        const panel = dropdown.querySelector(".mega");

        const toggle = () => {
          const open = panel.classList.contains("open");
          closeAll();
          if (!open) {
            panel.classList.add("open");
            trigger.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
          }
        };

        trigger.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
          e.stopPropagation();
          toggle();
        });

        dropdown.addEventListener("mouseenter", () => {
          if (window.innerWidth > 780) {
            closeAll();
            panel.classList.add("open");
            trigger.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
          }
        });

        dropdown.addEventListener("mouseleave", () => {
          if (window.innerWidth > 780) {
            panel.classList.remove("open");
            trigger.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
          }
        });
      });

      document.addEventListener("click", closeAll);
      document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
        if (e.key === "Escape") closeAll();
      });
    }

    renderFilters();
    renderFeatured();
    renderLatest();
    setupDropdowns();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
